                "text": "Vulnerability GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: golang.org/x/net\nVersion: v0.0.0-20220114011407-0dd24b26b47d\nFix Version: 0.17.0\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/pilot-agent\nData Namespace: github:language:go\nLink: [GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | golang.org/x/net  | v0.0.0-20220114011407-0dd24b26b47d  | 0.17.0  | go-module  | /usr/local/bin/pilot-agent  | github:language:go  | [GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qppj-fm5r-hxr3)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
