                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-32148\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.17.7\nFix Version: 1.17.12,1.18.4\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/pilot-agent\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-32148](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-32148)",
