                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2024-45808\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: envoy\nVersion: 1.21.0\nFix Version: 1.28.7,1.29.9,1.30.6,1.31.2\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/envoy\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2024-45808](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-45808)",
