              "id": "CVE-2024-32976-envoy",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-32976 high vulnerability for envoy package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Envoy is a cloud-native, open source edge and service proxy. Envoyproxy with a Brotli filter can get into an endless loop during decompression of Brotli data with extra input."
              },
