                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-26310\nSeverity: high\nPackage: envoy\nVersion: 1.21.0\nFix Version: 1.34.13,1.35.9,1.36.5,1.37.1\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/envoy\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2026-26310](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-26310)",
